{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a certain world, God has been gradually eradicating all living creatures from the world, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for reasons unknown, using his divine authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only surviving pig, in his solitude, vows to rebel against God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The former living creatures are now just souls. Summoning their last bit of strength, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they present themselves to the pig as the path to God, entrusting their future to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the main character, a pig, and head upwards while jumping over objects in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D action game in which you head upwards while avoiding flamethrowers along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821900?t=1757126228","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821900?t=1757126228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821900/1acf4f59b61ad0f07aeacec860149d35adb097c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757126228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821900/1acf4f59b61ad0f07aeacec860149d35adb097c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757126228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a certain world, God has been gradually eradicating all living creatures from the world, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for reasons unknown, using his divine authority.</p><p cl